    <span class="meadow-eyebrow">What it costs</span>
    <h1>An <em>honest</em> conversation about what gardens cost.</h1>
    <p class="meadow-lead">A garden is not a product. It is a slow construction with material costs, plant costs, labor, and one or two follow-up seasons of attention. Below are the ranges we work in, drawn from the last three years of completed projects.</p>
  </div>
