      <h2>Three engagement sizes.</h2>
      <p class="meadow-lead">Each of these is a real, scoped service &mdash; not a tier, not an "upgrade path." Pick the one that matches the work you want, or talk with us about what fits.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="meadow-features">
      <article class="meadow-feature">
