        <h3>Consultation only</h3>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--me-deep);margin:0.25rem 0 0.5rem;font-style:italic">$175</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--me-text-muted);margin-bottom:1rem">90 minutes on-site. We walk the land with you, talk about what you're hoping for, share an honest read on what we'd do. Notes emailed within a week.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--me-text);margin:0"><strong>Credited back</strong> against design fees if we work together within 12 months.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="meadow-feature">
        <div class="meadow-feature-icon" style="background:var(--me-terracotta);color:var(--me-cream)">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 21l5-5 4 4 9-9"/><path d="M14 7h7v7"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Planting plan</h3>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--me-deep);margin:0.25rem 0 0.5rem;font-style:italic">$2,400&ndash;$6,800</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--me-text-muted);margin-bottom:1rem">Detailed planting schedule, plant locations, seasonal emergence notes, two-year care guide. Delivered in 6&ndash;10 weeks. You install or hand off to your crew.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--me-text);margin:0"><strong>Includes</strong> a follow-up site visit at the start of year two.</p>
