        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--me-deep);margin:0.25rem 0 0.5rem;font-style:italic">12&ndash;18% of install</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--me-text-muted);margin-bottom:1rem">Site survey, schematic design, planting plan, material specifications, install supervision, two-year care plan. 9&ndash;14 months from first visit to first photograph.</p>
