<section class="meadow-section">
  <div class="meadow-container">
    <div style="max-width:680px;margin-bottom:2.5rem">
      <span class="meadow-eyebrow">Build &amp; install</span>
      <h2>What construction costs.</h2>
      <p class="meadow-lead">Every install is bid fixed-price after the design is finished and signed off. The ranges below are drawn from completed projects 2022&ndash;2025.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="meadow-editorial">
      <div class="meadow-editorial-media meadow-editorial-media--terra" data-label="Drystone Walls"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="meadow-eyebrow">Hand-stacked</span>
        <h3>Drystone walls &amp; terraces</h3>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.85rem;color:var(--me-terracotta-deep);margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;font-style:italic">$450&ndash;$950 per linear foot</p>
        <p>Local sandstone or quartzite, hand-set. Wall heights to 4 feet without engineering, taller with. Includes excavation, drainage, geo-fabric where the soil requires it, and topdress.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="meadow-editorial">
      <div class="meadow-editorial-media" data-label="Native Plant Installation"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="meadow-eyebrow">Plant material + labor</span>
        <h3>Native &amp; climate-adapted planting</h3>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.85rem;color:var(--me-terracotta-deep);margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;font-style:italic">$18&ndash;$42 per square foot</p>
        <p>Includes amended soil where needed, plant material from licensed CO native nurseries, drip-irrigation rough-in, and 2&ndash;3 inches of locally-sourced mulch.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="meadow-editorial">
      <div class="meadow-editorial-media meadow-editorial-media--terra" data-label="Hardscape: Patios &amp; Paths"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="meadow-eyebrow">Stone, gravel, paver</span>
        <h3>Patios, paths, gravel gardens</h3>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.85rem;color:var(--me-terracotta-deep);margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;font-style:italic">$28&ndash;$58 per square foot</p>
        <p>Reclaimed flagstone, decomposed granite, or set pavers. Permeable assemblies preferred to limit runoff. Includes base prep, edge restraints, and joint material.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="meadow-section meadow-section--cream-deep">
  <div class="meadow-container">
    <div style="max-width:680px;margin-bottom:2.5rem">
      <span class="meadow-eyebrow">Seasonal care</span>
      <h2>What ongoing maintenance costs.</h2>
      <p class="meadow-lead">Quarterly visits for past clients and a small selection of new gardens. Limited roster (max 18 maintenance gardens) so each one gets real attention.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="meadow-features">
      <article class="meadow-feature">
        <h3>Quarterly visit</h3>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2rem;color:var(--me-deep);margin:0.25rem 0 0.5rem;font-style:italic">$450&ndash;$850</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--me-text-muted);margin:0">Pruning to species, seasonal cutback, irrigation calibration, plant swaps for what's not thriving. About 3&ndash;5 hours on-site per visit.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="meadow-feature">
        <h3>Annual contract</h3>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2rem;color:var(--me-deep);margin:0.25rem 0 0.5rem;font-style:italic">$1,800&ndash;$3,400</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--me-text-muted);margin:0">Four visits, lockup pricing for the year. Includes one extra "rescue visit" inside the year for anything urgent (animal damage, broken irrigation, late-frost loss).</p>
      </article>
      <article class="meadow-feature">
        <h3>One-off check-in</h3>
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2rem;color:var(--me-deep);margin:0.25rem 0 0.5rem;font-style:italic">$285</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--me-text-muted);margin:0">For DIY clients who want a 2-hour walk-through of their own garden once or twice a year. Notes emailed within a week.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

